% expect-output: false
% Scenario: a change is recorded and a restore brings it back.
% The first stroke states false; inside gsave, true setstrokeadjust and a
% second stroke state true; after grestore the third stroke states false
% again (the pair holds no clip, so nothing in the output restores the
% setting on its own), and currentstrokeadjust answers false.
0.3 setlinewidth
72 500.4 moveto 400 500.4 lineto stroke
gsave
  true setstrokeadjust
  72 480.7 moveto 400 480.7 lineto stroke
grestore
72 460.2 moveto 400 460.2 lineto stroke
currentstrokeadjust =
showpage
